   <property name="html">
    <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:7.8pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot; bgcolor=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:5px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,Sans-serif'; font-size:14pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Basinga&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,Sans-serif'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:600; color:#00709c;&quot;&gt;Tab : &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,Sans-serif'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Production rates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,Sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#00709c;&quot;&gt;Summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,Sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600; color:#000020;&quot;&gt;This tool computes the basin average scaling factors and  cosmogenic production rates for different nuclides (3He,21Ne and 10Be). It requires at least a polygon shape file of the drainage basins and a D.E.M of the studied area. The calculations follow either the scaling scheme developed by Stone (2000) slightly modified to include slow and fast muon production (Braucher et al., 2011) or the LSD model developped by Lifton et al. (2014).The tool also provides four corrective options that account for (1) quartz zone locations, (2) topographic shielding factor, (3) ice cover shielding factor and (4) paleomagnetic changes. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,Sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#00709c;&quot;&gt;Syntax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,Sans-serif'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:496; color:#000020;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;30%&quot; bgcolor=&quot;#dddddd&quot; style=&quot; vertical-align:bottom;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,Sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600; color:#000020;&quot;&gt;Parameter &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;50%&quot; bgcolor=&quot;#dddddd&quot; style=&quot; vertical-align:bottom;&quot;&gt;
