&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600; color:#000020; background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;This tool computes the basin average denudation rates based on the basin average production rate. The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600; font-style:italic; color:#000020; background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;Production rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600; color:#000020; background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;s tool must have been ran first to provide the cosmogenic production rates needed for the calculation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Verdana,Gill,Helvetica,Sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; color:#000020;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
